e","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"aklDnLm1843Lvr1cF0iaig","review_id":"XZiKb0ytdyKRGL6vYQ0BLw","date":"2018-05-02T21:46:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9291591644287109,"text_excerpt":"It was impossible to resist the yummy treats openly displayed as we strolled down the street, and so we popped inside to try some samples. I asked a staff member when they opened and was surprised to find out they only recently opened up in October of 2017. The staff was extremely friendly and all members seemed super happy with what they were doing and the products they were serving, creating a very welcoming atmosphere. I highly, highly recommend getting the salted caramel ice cream (in a waffle cone). It was EXTREMELY good and packed a huge whallop of flavor inside. I can easily see why the ice cream server mentioned that it was one of their most popular items. After tasting a bunch of..."},{"business_id":"aklDnLm1843Lvr1cF0iaig","review_id":"FdrjEo86r4fsWfnvQ8W_pQ","date":"2017-11-15T21:36:27","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9227006435394287,"text_excerpt":"We were walking towards the French Market and came across this dessert shop. We were instantly drawn in by the decor and the amount of goodies they had! I went to the back of the store where the ice cream was located and saw the multiple flavors they had! I believe I tried 3 flavors (can't remember which ones though) but I ended up getting the toasted coconut. The toasted coconut was really good because it wasn't too sweet compared to other ice creams. You could also really taste the coconut in there as well. Needless to say, stop by Kilwins if you're in the area!"},{"business_id":"aklDnLm1843Lvr1cF0iaig","review_id":"EIXZtvknLi2OhJGcrfx3Kw","date":"2018-08-20T01:37:10","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9224365949630737,"text_excerpt":"Came here to enjoy some desserts after having lunch in the area. This place looked really nice when I walked in and I couldn't believe that it was my first time checking it out! The line was a bit long when I got there, but it moved fast. The workers were helpful, friendly, and worked efficiently. My friends and I ordered the Blueberry Waffle Cone, Sea Salt Caramel, and Cappuccino Chocolate Chip ice cream to put on waffle cones. After I got my ice cream, one of the workers saw me position my ice cream cone for the perfect picture and asked me, \"Are you posting that on Yelp?!\" How did he know?! I replied with a big YEAH and he thanked me. I thought that was pretty hilarious! Loved the enth..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"aklDnLm1843Lvr1cF0iaig","photo_id":"dXa6AlZghnmc4NIBGt13Ug","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/dXa6AlZghnmc4NIBGt13Ug.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8985117673873901},{"business_id":"aklDnLm1843Lvr1cF0iaig","photo_id":"yIc9GPzNV79Fc3r8sdoCfA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/yIc9GPzNV79Fc3r8sdoCfA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8976933360099792},{"business_id":"aklDnLm1843Lvr1cF0iaig","photo_id":"Nt4-fv70Zf8kySIycBXUjw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Nt4-fv70Zf8kySIycBXUjw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.88703852891922},{"business_id":"aklDnLm1843Lvr1cF0iaig","photo_id":"LaKz2GUD5-DoxoLwo8MUwA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/LaKz2GUD5-DoxoLwo8MUwA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.809630274772644},{"business_id":"aklDnLm1843Lvr1cF0iaig","photo_id":"sgAexRrh2EnEb5gdXWlNcQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/sgAexRrh2EnEb5gdXWlNcQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.777333676815033}]},"notebook_case":null}
